side, and\n<STRUCT_0003> for every <MATH_0012>, and any\n<MATH_0013> there exists a covering\n<MATH_0014> such that for every <MATH_0015> the\nobject <MATH_0016> is in the essential image of the\nfunctor <MATH_0017>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nMoreover the stack in groupoids <MATH_0018> is determined up to unique\n<MATH_0019>-isomorphism by these conditions.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b32ad00674a0ee4e1d92e8f1567eb95f8f2c097532143f430677f8884eb0f011", "unit_id": "tag:02ZP:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02ZO", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-stackify}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-stack-in-groupoids-stack}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ec4abc9bd174f60cab916a136e132fc84322b7412e75fdb9a4e173c99b8e2b77", "source_text": "Apply Lemma <REF_0001>. The result will be a\nstack in groupoids by applying Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4ce62745644bb5f2aa1138cdd5fd10cd9275f7ce895e545a2b5afcc2a78f37c6", "unit_id": "tag:02ZP:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02ZO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$p' : \\mathcal{S}' \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$G : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{S}'$", "MATH_0006": "$1$", "MATH_0007": "$q : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "MATH_0009": "$F : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0011": "$1$", "MATH_0012": "$H : \\mathcal{S}' \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0013": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{S} \\ar[rr]_F \\ar[rd]_G & & \\mathcal{X} \\\\\n& \\mathcal{S}' \\ar[ru]_H\n}\n$$", "MATH_0014": "$2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-stackify-groupoids}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-stackify-groupoids-universal-property}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:04ebdc930136cbdd2d1c2ea7c518b7ada1c89a8c9beab0972ad8338787eb13ce", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4ab3719177df34f65bbceb430a5fd537c6e0a1da15d92a3190c0f9c6a079ebca", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a category fibred in groupoids\nover <MATH_0003>. Let <MATH_0004> and\n<MATH_0005>\nthe stack in groupoids and <MATH_0006>-morphism constructed in\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nThis construction has the following universal property: Given a stack\nin groupoids <MATH_0007> and a <MATH_0008>-morphism\n<MATH_0009> of categories over <MATH_0010>\nthere exists a <MATH_0011>-morphism <MATH_0012>\nsuch that the diagram\n<MATH_0013>\nis <MATH_0014>-commutative.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:95c8d56f25edcbcd8122e426d0ea5fa5797f388ed9fc7fc122c5bbdea147fadf", "unit_id": "tag:0436:statement"}
